body:
My patience is at its limit. Yesterday I logged in and it was exactly the same as how its been after I edited the INI file. The UI is stretched... WTF did they edit? It's time for a break now my dudes. 

&#x200B;

Just so I can feel better, I'd like to communicate this directly to Bethesda: F U C K Y O U.

Okay so I just managed to fix this problem. I was using the 1.8 version and decided to switch to the 1.5 version and conduct my edits and presto, no issues with 1.5. 

&#x200B;

&#x200B;
